{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24200","headline":"侍中晋公欲到东洛先蒙书问期宿龙门思往感今輙献长句 · 白居易","name":"侍中晋公欲到东洛先蒙书问期宿龙门思往感今輙献长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔蒙兴化池头送，今许龙门潭上期。\n聚散但慙长见念，荣枯安敢道相思。\n功成名遂来虽久，云卧山游去未迟。\n闻说风情筋力在，只如初破蔡州时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}